OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APeace talks rich in symbolism but
OL,4,Afundamental differences between Russia
OL,5,Aand Ukraine remain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe symbolism of Ukrainian President
OL,8,FZelensky greeting Steve Witkoff and
OL,9,FJared Kushner at Kyiv's Saint Sophia
OL,10,FCathedral, not only an icon of
OL,11,FUkraine's ancient history, but also
OL,12,Fjust a few yards from where Russian
OL,13,Fdrones hit the headquarters of the
OL,14,Fcountry's security services on Friday.
OL,16,FYou did not have to join too many dots
OL,17,Fto work out the point Zelensky was
OL,18,Fmaking.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
